    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to bring to the market 22 Town Court, Shannon, a two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment ideally situated in the heart of Shannon.\n\nThis apartment offers an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer looking to take their first step onto the property ladder or an investor seeking a property in a convenient and established location. The accommodation is well laid out and provides two good-sized bedrooms together with a living area, kitchen and bathroom.\n\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property's main attractions. Town Court is situated within easy walking distance of Shannon Town Centre and Skycourt Shopping Centre, providing a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. The property is also close to local schools, Shannon Leisure Centre, sporting facilities and the public library.\n\nFor those commuting, Shannon's major employment centres, including the Shannon Free Zone and Smithstown Industrial Estate, are within easy reach. Shannon Airport is also conveniently located, while the M18 motorway provides straightforward access to Limerick, Ennis and the wider region.\n\n22 Town Court represents a good opportunity to acquire an affordable two-bedroom apartment in a highly convenient Shannon location. With its central position and practical accommodation, the property would make an ideal first home or investment property.\n\nViewing is recommended to appreciate the accommodation and location on offer."
      },
